//! # English Synonym Table: Moby Thesaurus II
//!
//! Compile-time perfect-hash map of ~25,083 English head words to their
//! synonym lists, sourced from the **Moby Thesaurus II** by Grady Ward
//! (public domain, released January 2001).
//!
//! ## Data Source
//!
//! Downloaded from Project Gutenberg:
//! <https://www.gutenberg.org/files/3202/files/mthesaur.txt>
//!
//! > The Moby Thesaurus data was compiled by Grady Ward and released into the
//! > public domain in January 2001.  No restrictions apply to its use,
//! > modification, or redistribution.
//!
//! ## Filtering
//!
//! - Only head words and synonyms that are purely ASCII-alphabetic single
//!   tokens (no spaces, hyphens, or accented characters) are retained.
//! - Synonym lists are capped at 16 entries per head word.
//! - Head words are lower-cased; duplicates are merged.
//!
//! ## Lookup Characteristics
//!
//! Lookups are O(1) and require no heap allocation (perfect hash at compile
//! time via the `phf` crate).

